### 9. ROLE_USER edits someone else's booking -> 403 (currently 200: no ownership check)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{blockerId}}/edit
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{adminId}},
  "roomId": {{roomId}},
  "startsAt": "{{blockerStartsAt}}",
  "endsAt": "{{blockerEndsAt}}",
  "purpose": "hijacked"
}

> {%
    client.test("non-owner is forbidden", () => {
        client.assert(response.status === 403, "expected 403, got " + response.status);
    });
%}

### 10a. Cleanup: delete the booking under test
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/delete/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10b. Cleanup: delete the blocker
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/delete/{{blockerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}